    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Delta's Discs is a 2D metroidvania, where you control Delta, a warrior duck who has forgotten his own identity. After months in a coma, you wake up in a world that is not the same as before. Venture into this vast open map, dominated by an oppressive empire, while collecting discs that will help Delta regain his memory, make new friends and overthrow the squirrel dictatorship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Huge open and non-linear map to explore.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Variety of biomes, atmosphere and enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(Sometimes) Friendly and (always) charismatic NPCs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Funny and challenging boss fights.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secrets, mysteries and puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Power-ups, abilities and upgradable weapon.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collectable items and optimized inventory system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different endings, depending on your choices.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(Not so funny) Humor and comedy</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Delta's Discs is a 2D metroidvania, where you control Delta, a warrior duck who has forgotten his own identity. After months in a coma, you wake up in a world that is not the same as before. Venture into this vast open map, dominated by an oppressive empire, while collecting discs that will help Delta regain his memory, make new friends and overthrow the squirrel dictatorship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Huge open and non-linear map to explore.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Variety of biomes, atmosphere and enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(Sometimes) Friendly and (always) charismatic NPCs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Funny and challenging boss fights.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secrets, mysteries and puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Power-ups, abilities and upgradable weapon.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collectable items and optimized inventory system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different endings, depending on your choices.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(Not so funny) Humor and comedy</p></li></ul>",
